  "title": "Why Manual Processes Are Unsustainable for Small Agencies",
  "summary": "Government efficiency is often framed as a question of speed: faster approvals, less paperwork, or streamlined workflows. But in many public sector organizations, especially smaller districts and departments, the larger operational risk is dependency on manual processes. For SAU 14 Epping Schools in New Hampshire, that reality became difficult to sustain. Like many districts, Epping Schools operates with a lean administrative team responsible for finance, HR, payroll, compliance,...",
